silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_03_materialization_spine_sections_04_install_and_observe_concrete_anchor_5#vetrecordaboutmittens silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecordAboutMittens is In section 'Install and Observe: The Spine Closes' the bare symbol left(Hom(-,R),,Hom(R,-)right) anchors to VetRecordAboutMittens: The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling." .
